<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised</p>
<p>short-term discount note rates Thursday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.08</p>
<p> -		   Nov 15--5.14</p>
<p> -		   Nov 22--5.17</p>
<p> -	   Dec 10,11,16--5.18</p>
<p> -		 Jan 7,14--5.17</p>
<p> -	     Feb 6,7,10--5.18</p>
<p> -		    Mar 7--5.18</p>
</text>
